---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    Ph.D. candidate specializing in finite element analysis and biomechanics with extensive 
    experience in computational modeling of soft tissues. Expertise in ABAQUS, Python, 
    and machine learning applications for mechanical systems. Passionate about solving 
    complex engineering problems through computational methods and data-driven approaches.
    Seeking industrial roles in FEA engineering, mechanical design, and materials engineering.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Ph.D. in Mechanical Engineering"
      subtitle="2021 to Present at University of Louisiana at Lafayette, Lafayette, LA - GPA: 3.8/4.0"
    >
      Focus: Biomechanics, Finite Element Analysis, Soft Tissue Mechanics
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="M.Sc. in Mechanical Engineering"
      subtitle="2019 to 2021 at University of Louisiana at Lafayette, Lafayette, LA - GPA: 3.9/4.0"
    >
      Focus: Computational Mechanics, Finite Element Analysis
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="B.Sc. in Mechanical Engineering"
      subtitle="2013 to 2017 at Islamic University of Technology (IUT), Bangladesh - CGPA: 3.56/4.0"
    >
      Focus: Mechanical Design, Thermodynamics
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Graduate Research Assistant"
      subtitle="2021 to Present at University of Louisiana at Lafayette, Lafayette, LA"
    >
      Developed finite element models for soft tissue biomechanics using ABAQUS. Implemented poro-hyperelastic 
      material models for biological tissues. Applied machine learning techniques for mechanical property prediction. 
      Published research in peer-reviewed journals and conference proceedings.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Service Engineer"
      subtitle="2018 to 2021 at AUDI, Dhaka, Bangladesh"
    >
      Performed maintenance and troubleshooting of power generators. Managed service operations and customer 
      technical support. Conducted performance analysis and optimization of mechanical systems.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Technical Intern"
      subtitle="2017 at Walton Hi-Tech Industries Ltd., Gazipur, Bangladesh"
    >
      Gained hands-on experience in CNC machining and manufacturing processes. Assisted in quality control 
      and production optimization. Learned industrial safety standards and maintenance procedures.
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Certifications & Awards</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>Graduate Research Fellowship - UT Arlington (2021)</li>
    <li>Outstanding Teaching Assistant - ME Department (2022)</li>
    <li>Best Paper Award - ASME Conference (2023)</li>
    <li>Research Excellence Grant - University (2023)</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-5 columns-2 mx-6">
    <li>ABAQUS</li>
    <li>SolidWorks</li>
    <li>ANSYS</li>
    <li>Python</li>
    <li>MATLAB</li>
    <li>LaTeX</li>
    <li>Machine Learning</li>
    <li>TensorFlow</li>
    <li>scikit-learn</li>
    <li>NumPy/SciPy</li>
    <li>Git</li>
    <li>Linux</li>
    <li>Docker</li>
    <li>CNN</li>
    <li>Image Processing</li>
    <li>FEA</li>
    <li>Biomechanics</li>
    <li>Material Science</li>
    <li>CFD</li>
    <li>Thermodynamics</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
